00:19:23.203 --> 00:19:25.038
- True. True.

00:19:25.038 --> 00:19:28.333
And I'm a firm believer in that.
Like, it has to start somewhere.

00:19:28.333 --> 00:19:30.252
And I know somebody will be
quick to say,

00:19:30.252 --> 00:19:31.753
"Well, you didn't."

00:19:31.753 --> 00:19:34.965
I think that if kids
do go to these HBCUs,

00:19:34.965 --> 00:19:37.551
that we've seen that
the networks or whatever,

00:19:37.551 --> 00:19:39.469
they're gonna come
wherever the kids are.

