And so you gotta move on.

00:19:57.529 --> 00:19:58.906
You know, that was
one of the toughest things

00:19:58.906 --> 00:20:01.867
I think I dealt with was,
you know,

00:20:01.867 --> 00:20:05.537
how close, you know,
and then it didn't happen.

00:20:05.537 --> 00:20:08.207
So gotta get back to work.

00:20:08.207 --> 00:20:10.167
- Absolutely. OK.
Well—

00:20:10.167 --> 00:20:12.336
I have successfully spent
the entire off-day with you.

00:20:12.336 --> 00:20:13.879
- Yeah, and that's a sick game
right there.
[Laughing]

00:20:13.879 --> 00:20:15.547
I'mma use that,
just for the record.

00:20:15.547 --> 00:20:17.257
- Because it's, like,
you gotta pick one.

00:20:17.257 --> 00:20:19.009
- Gotta make a decision.
- And the "why?" part.

